{
  "id": 72762295,
  "iid": 451,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "QUIC: fix dissection of Short Header packets with Grease QUIC bit",
  "description": "The condition aimed to avoid interpreting padding bytes after the\nInitial Packet as Short Header to avoid breaking decryption. However it\nalso prevents actual Short Header packets from being matched that have\nthe QUIC bit cleared.\n\nTo avoid breaking the latter, strengthen the condition to match the\nformer only. Tested with quic-31_grease_quic_bit__with_keys.pcapng (from\n!429). Regression tested against a private Firefox Nightly trace.",
  "state": "merged",
